<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">transmuter</ansi>

The Transmuter is the neutral elite of the Mutagenist (Alchemist route; no
alignment asked). Its Mutagen hardens a second ally beside the patient for
nothing, then the patient's whole row, and its Bracing Tonic lasts longer.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Ranks</ansi>

  30 Twin mutagen       a Mutagen also hardens one ally beside its patient in
                        the same row, paid for by neither
  35 Alloyed mutagen    a Mutagen gives +20 armor
  40 Long tonic         a Bracing Tonic lasts 4 rounds longer (7 in all)
  45 Hardened mutagen   a Mutagen gives +25 armor
  50 Deeper satchel     +4 flasks in the satchel
  55 Transmuter's skin  +8% maximum health
  60 Row mutagen        a Mutagen hardens its patient's whole row

It needs the Mutagenist first (<ansi fg="command">help alchemist-routes</ansi>) and keeps every rank of it. At level 30 a
character that holds it promotes with <ansi fg="command">class promote [member] transmuter confirm</ansi>. Any alignment may take it.
Everything here lasts only for the battle and is never saved.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Elite talents</ansi>

Elite Alchemist talents (levels 35, 45, 55): Iron Hide (+5 Armor), Master
Brewer (+4 flasks in the satchel), Potent Flasks (Healing Draught heals 15%
more and Fire Flask burns 15% harder). See <ansi fg="command">help
talents</ansi>.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help alchemist-routes</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help alchemist</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help elite</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help promotion</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.
